    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce to the top in this skill based, roguelite action-platformer! Collect powerful items, pick unique weapons, and fight off a variety of enemies while navigating around with a fun, difficult, and unique movement system. Are you up for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/b20f13ee5bf39a4ec214d432fdd2dad9.poster.avif?t=1738122170\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/b20f13ee5bf39a4ec214d432fdd2dad9.webm?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/b20f13ee5bf39a4ec214d432fdd2dad9.mp4?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Master the unique Pogo Stick Movement mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/14d041716f0eea8418e73659baf41840.poster.avif?t=1738122170\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/14d041716f0eea8418e73659baf41840.webm?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/14d041716f0eea8418e73659baf41840.mp4?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Find dozens of unique weapons, powerups, and items to customize your play through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/c1d39188bc0b5a25da18e44f6e786f2a.poster.avif?t=1738122170\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/c1d39188bc0b5a25da18e44f6e786f2a.webm?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/c1d39188bc0b5a25da18e44f6e786f2a.mp4?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enjoy the Retro Vibe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/d1c069641506016671d84f9140393e05.poster.avif?t=1738122170\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/d1c069641506016671d84f9140393e05.webm?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/d1c069641506016671d84f9140393e05.mp4?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Replay over and over again thanks to the procedural generation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Powerups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Movement System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fights</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/3e16fa0f508e25954f959b7c09c2bfef.webp?t=1738122170\" width=300 height=63 /></span>Pogo Rogue was developed by students in the Division of Games at the University of Utah</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounce to the top in this skill based, roguelite action-platformer! Collect powerful items, pick unique weapons, and fight off a variety of enemies while navigating around with a fun, difficult, and unique movement system. Are you up for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/b20f13ee5bf39a4ec214d432fdd2dad9.poster.avif?t=1738122170\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/b20f13ee5bf39a4ec214d432fdd2dad9.webm?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/b20f13ee5bf39a4ec214d432fdd2dad9.mp4?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Master the unique Pogo Stick Movement mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/14d041716f0eea8418e73659baf41840.poster.avif?t=1738122170\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/14d041716f0eea8418e73659baf41840.webm?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/14d041716f0eea8418e73659baf41840.mp4?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Find dozens of unique weapons, powerups, and items to customize your play through!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/c1d39188bc0b5a25da18e44f6e786f2a.poster.avif?t=1738122170\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/c1d39188bc0b5a25da18e44f6e786f2a.webm?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/c1d39188bc0b5a25da18e44f6e786f2a.mp4?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enjoy the Retro Vibe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/d1c069641506016671d84f9140393e05.poster.avif?t=1738122170\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/d1c069641506016671d84f9140393e05.webm?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/d1c069641506016671d84f9140393e05.mp4?t=1738122170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Replay over and over again thanks to the procedural generation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Powerups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique Movement System</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Generation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss Fights</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2870280/extras/3e16fa0f508e25954f959b7c09c2bfef.webp?t=1738122170\" width=300 height=63 /></span>Pogo Rogue was developed by students in the Division of Games at the University of Utah</p>",
